OL,11,G0200 Trucking Heavy
OL,12,     FAt a limestone quarry in
OL,13,     FYorkshire, hauliers are tasked
OL,14,     Fwith moving a pair of stone
OL,15,     Fcrushers, each weighing over
OL,16,     F70-tonnes. In Southampton, a boat
OL,17,     Fhaulier team prepare a survey
OL,18,     Fvessel.
